Samael was an angel who led [[Org/Sacrament|Sacrament]], and worshipped the Patchwork Prince, [[Divinity/Unknown Entities/Mephistopheles|Mephistopheles]], as his god. At the massacre in [[Geography/Ushas/Sigil|Sigil]] he called out the party that would found [[Org/Sedecium|Sedecium]] as antagonists and heathens against his god, and vowed to put them in the ground one day. At the seat of Ruin, one of the [[Divinity/Higher Kind|Higher Kind]] of [[Geography/Ushas/index|Ushas]], he pressed a large golden needle into Ruin's divine body and killed it. The party destroyed Sacrament.
